{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:1b71f904cf3147dd","name":"DD-13 Medical Assistant Droid","source":{"id":"source:reference-1b71f904cf3147dd","title":"DD-13 Medical Assistant Droid","revision":19870,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:46:03Z","sha256":"d712f946c491ad7f449344eda98f8392e14f7a2400bac0b80398a2a157713a3e","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19870","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=DD-13%20Medical%20Assistant%20Droid&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-1b71f904cf3147dd","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Officially dubbed the Model DD-13, this Droid is created by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ubrikkian Transports"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ubrikkian_Transports?action=edit&redlink=1"},", a company more commonly associated with repulsorlift ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"},". The DD-13 gains the nickname \"Galactic Chopper\" from ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Commanders"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Commanders"}," who know of the model's origins and who witness the Droid in action in the field.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Oddly enough, Ubrikkian originally designs the Droid to be used aboard its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Medlifter Troop Transports"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Medlifter_Troop_Transports?action=edit&redlink=1"},". When the transports prove less useful than originally anticipated, Ubrikkian redistributes the Droids as medical assistants and battlefield Medical Droids with updated databases and medical tools installed within the two upper arms. The Droid's cylindrical head, which sits atop its three-legged body, is equipped with specially calibrated medical sensors that help it perform procedures with extreme precision. Droids of this model do not converse much, if at all, with patients, preferring to work without any distractions.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["DD-13 Medical Assistant Droids can't be played as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Heroes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Heroes"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["DD-13 Medical Assistant Droid Statistics (CL 1)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n","Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["1st-Degree Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/1st-Degree_Droid"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," 3\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +1; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Low-Light Vision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Low-Light_Vision"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +10\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Basic, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Binary"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Binary","referenceId":"reference:ee1c8277caf5fb9b"},", 2 Unassigned\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 10 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 10), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 9, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},": 12\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"refe